{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S01、S05等短停留段仍有较多未标时点的感受词，纵向逐行扫读的负担略大于Y，Y的右栏短词更容易快速掠过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮的关键短语建立了很清楚的心理主线，观众更容易抓住每段发生了什么、人物为什么产生这种反应。感受词又通过小节时点和细致的音乐、身体感受，把情绪变化具体地呈现出来，使从最初不敢表达，到害怕失去，再到接受不确定性、不再隐藏喜欢的过程更有连续性。Y的阅读负担较轻，但右栏短词有时只是并列的感受标签，音乐变化与心理转折之间的对应没有X那么细密。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "52c948dd-ceb0-4dc0-a6ba-60796f6d98a6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T062524963817Z", "elapsed_seconds": 132.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:27:37.621656+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a552f95382b8b373805e1e40f3a93638815115c73a46c315cf701f0dc6ca8d71", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_